diff --git a/README.md b/README.md
index db5a398..4876d80 100644
--- a/README.md
+++ b/README.md
@@ -21,6 +21,17 @@ The build will create two jar files:
 * the command line interface in the cli/target folder
 * the interactive explorer in the codeexplorer/target folder
 
+### Commands
+
+> java -jar sokrates.jar <command> <options>
+
+* `init`: creates an analysis configuration file
+* `generateReports`: generates Sokrates reports based on the analysis configuration
+* `analyzeLandscape`: creates or refreshes a landscape report (`<analysisRoot>/_sokrates_landscape/index.html`), aggregating the analyses found under an analysis root (`-analysisRoot`, `-recursive`, `-confFile`, ...); the landscape counterpart of the analysis commands
+* `updateLandscape`: the previous name of `analyzeLandscape`, still supported; behaves exactly the same
+
+Use `java -jar sokrates.jar <command> -help` for the usage of a command.
+
 ### Docker
 
